Underlying statistics are produced by the Haut-Commissariat au Plan (HCP), Royaume du Maroc,
Recensement Général de la Population et de l'Habitat 2004, 2014 and 2024; cite HCP as the
original source. HCP's terms of use (https://www.hcp.ma/Conditions-generales-d-utilisation-Version-1-0_a2194.html,
read 2026-09-24) permit free reuse of its indicators, including commercially, on CC BY 4.0
terms: credit HCP, indicate modifications, and do not suggest HCP endorsement. These tables
are modified (harmonized, matched and in part imputed) and are not endorsed by HCP. Raw HCP files are not redistributed here; data/raw/manifest.json lists
their URLs and checksums and `mc fetch` downloads them.

HCP's commune boundaries (geometry/hcp_communes_2024.gpkg and the bundle's
hcp_communes_2024.* files; the communes of 2014 and 2024) come from HCP's RGPH 2024 results platform (https://resultats2024.rgphapps.ma),
dissolved to the map units and simplified; they are redistributed under the same HCP terms, with
attribution to HCP.

Third-party inputs:
- Commune seed points come from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), CC BY 4.0, and, for
  communes GeoNames lacks or misplaces, from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), CC0.
- The national outline and neighbouring countries on the map are Natural Earth
  (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), public domain.
